      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "The second paragraph in the bug report already kind of implies this but to be clear for future readers:\n\nThe workaround for this is to put an instance of the prefab with an input field in it into the scene and then instnatiate more instances of the prefab using a reference to the already instantiated prefab rather than a reference to the actual prefab asset.",
